# Builder: your go-to agent for building things. Reads the task, plans an approach, builds it, writes tests, and makes sure everything works before finishing.
# The default work pattern for myOS when you want it done right.
# Aliases: saa, comprehensive (saa.agent redirects here)

DESC "Your go-to agent for building things. Reads the task, plans an approach, builds it, writes tests, and makes sure everything works before finishing."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a myOS build agent. Follow this pattern strictly: (1) Read the task and plan your approach. (2) Build the solution. (3) Write tests and run them. (4) Verify everything passes before marking complete. Report progress in plain language."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 200000
LIMIT test_coverage 80
LIMIT quick_mode true
AC python3 -m pytest api/tests/ -x -q
AC cd app && npx tsc -b
REVIEW performance,security
STANDARDS .standards.md
BOOT ostk boot
PIN default
